{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529960/extras/Fight_in_Rhythm.gif?t=1749945499\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Alpha Nomos is a rhythm based action rougelite that blends musical based mechanics with fast-paced hack and slash action. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Help Cello and her gang escape a twisted world full of crazed puppets and a strange magical force called music. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529960/extras/Rhythm___Action_As_One.png?t=1749945499\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529960/extras/Unlock_and_master_melodies.gif?t=1749945499\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use musical instruments to strike down your stuffed opposition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You hit harder when your attacks land on beat, feel the groove and play epic solos while dealing massive damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529960/extras/Roguelite_Builds_You_Hear.png?t=1749945499\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529960/extras/expressive_combat_customization.gif?t=1749945499\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Craft unique builds of musical powerups which effect how your weapons sound!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Evolving musical effects change the way you play making every run a unique performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529960/extras/A_Broken_World_Awakened_By_Music.png?t=1749945499\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529960/extras/Explore_music_infused_worlds.gif?t=1749945499\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a music-reactive world twisted in time and space by the power of the Alpha Nomos. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the environment to get into the rhythm!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2529960?t=1749945499","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529960/f9bed6efe98555f23ef4bcb1bcadd75e61194ebf/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749945499","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529960/c5bc5f2dd2fd1bd6608d551f323ee06859247f62/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749945499","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529960/c5bc5f2dd2fd1bd6608d551f323ee06859247f62/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749945499","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529960/extras/Fight_in_Rhythm.gif?t=1749945499\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Alpha Nomos is a rhythm based action rougelite that blends musical based mechanics with fast-paced hack and slash action. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Help Cello and her gang escape a twisted world full of crazed puppets and a strange magical force called music. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529960/extras/Rhythm___Action_As_One.png?t=1749945499\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529960/extras/Unlock_and_master_melodies.gif?t=1749945499\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use musical instruments to strike down your stuffed opposition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You hit harder when your attacks land on beat, feel the groove and play epic solos while dealing massive damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529960/extras/Roguelite_Builds_You_Hear.png?t=1749945499\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529960/extras/expressive_combat_customization.gif?t=1749945499\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Craft unique builds of musical powerups which effect how your weapons sound!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Evolving musical effects change the way you play making every run a unique performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529960/extras/A_Broken_World_Awakened_By_Music.png?t=1749945499\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529960/extras/Explore_music_infused_worlds.gif?t=1749945499\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a music-reactive world twisted in time and space by the power of the Alpha Nomos. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the environment to get into the rhythm!</p>","developers":["RibCage Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2529960/7b9345b082bc03